From ab44988c70f6329c30f0a0af866dc91fbc5c9f0e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ObliviOS Build <build@oblivios.local>
Date: Mon, 24 Aug 2026 11:39:54 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] oblivios: the duress decoy user type, its routing, the switch
 authorization and the hiding of the real user

Squash of former patches:

- 0001 oblivios: add the duress decoy user type, routing and keyguard hook, and quiesce the real user during a decoy session
- 0002 oblivios: hide the real user from the decoy session's UI and conceal multi-user existence
- 0003 oblivios: authorize a single-credential decoy switch and the return path, and remove the unlock swipe
- 0004 oblivios: report real quiesce failures and ignore a decoy registration whose user no longer exists
- 0005 oblivios: let Settings ask whether a PIN is the duress wipe PIN
- 0006 oblivios: put the decoy user type in sorted order in system-current.txt
- 0007 oblivios: never offer user switching on a locked device
